# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, The Cradle & The Crescent — Front Matter (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** The Cradle & The Crescent (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, credits and Author Biographies (p. 2)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> The credits and Author Biographies, verbatim. The printed Contents and List of Inserts (pp. 3–7) are a finding
> aid for the book’s own pages and are not converted — every unit they list is converted in its chapter. Page 1 is
> the cover and page 192 the publisher’s advertisement of other books, neither with text.

